<title>USA: New Britain, Conn., $112.2 mln taxables priced.</title>
<headline>New Britain, Conn., $112.2 mln taxables priced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gates Capital Corp said Thursday it tentatively priced $112.2 million New Britain, Conn., general obligation taxable bonds, with the 2026 maturity priced at a spread to Treasuries of 85 basis points.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:  </p>
<p>NEW BRITAIN, CONN</p>
<p>$112,210,000*</p>
<p>GENERAL OBLIGATION PENSION BONDS</p>
<p>(FEDERALLY TAXABLE)</p>
<p>NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>FGIC INSURED AAA/AAA (97-20)</p>
<p>AMBAC INSURED AAA/AAA (21-26)</p>
<p>A/A UNDERLYING</p>
<p>DATED: 9/15/96</p>
<p>FIRST COUPON: 3/1/97</p>
<p>EXPECTED SETTLEMENT: 9/26/96</p>
